            <p class="Division"><a name="13.21.002"></a>Division 13-21-002<br />Addendum to MAG Uniform Standard Details for Public Works Construction</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1321002.html#13.21.002.0001">13-21-002-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Portland Cement Concrete Exposed to Weather</p>

